{"at":"2026-10-13T11:26:52.737Z","tool":"submit_plan","args":"{\"issue\":11404,\"plan\":\"## Text properties\\ncreate TC-1: \\\"Italic\\\" toggle: making a text italic and upright again\\ncreate TC-2: Ctrl+I / Cmd+I on a selected text in each desktop browser\\ncreate TC-3: Ctrl+I while editing a text with part of it highlighted\\ncreate TC-4: Ctrl+I with nothing selected\\n","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T11:28:05.267Z","tool":"save_changes","args":"{\"issue\":11404,\"content\":\"Scope: italic text (one italic property per text element, set with the \\\"Italic\\\" toggle or Ctrl+I / Cmd+I). Desktop Chrome, Firefox, Safari and Edge on Windows and macOS, plus the mobile layout at 375 px wide. Shortcuts are written for Windows; on macOS use Cmd instead of ","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T11:28:08.265Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"Italic is one property of the whole text element, set with an \\\"Italic\\\" toggle in the properties panel or Ctrl+I (Cmd+I on macOS); there is no partial italic, no separate italic font, and bold is out of scope.\",\"source\":\"Product owner's answers 1 and 2 on issue 114","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T11:28:09.869Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"The \\\"Italic\\\" toggle sits next to the text align control with tooltip \\\"Italic (Ctrl+I)\\\" and is shown when a text, a shape with text or an arrow with a label is selected, or the Text tool is active; it is never disabled, for any font.\",\"source\":\"Accepted suggested","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T11:28:11.621Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"Ctrl+I (Cmd+I) toggles italic on the selected text or on the whole text being edited, even when only part of it is highlighted; with nothing selected it does nothing, and the browser's own Ctrl+I action (such as Firefox \\\"Page Info\\\") never opens while the canvas ha","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T11:28:13.270Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"Fonts without an italic face may use a synthetic slant; italic text stays readable and unclipped in Latin, Cyrillic, Chinese, Japanese, Arabic, Hebrew, emoji and mixed scripts, with direction and alignment unchanged, and whether emoji slant is left to the browser.\",","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T11:28:14.572Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"With several texts selected and only some italic, the \\\"Italic\\\" toggle shows as not pressed; one click makes all italic and a second click makes all upright.\",\"source\":\"Accepted suggested answer 6 on issue 11404, 2026-10-13, approved by maxxx\",\"issue\":11404}","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T11:28:15.822Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"The last chosen italic value, on or off, becomes the default for new text, and color and opacity changes keep a text italic.\",\"source\":\"Product owner's answers 7 and 14 on issue 11404, 2026-10-13, approved by maxxx\",\"issue\":11404}","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T11:28:17.420Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"bound-text\",\"fact\":\"Italic text inside a shape re-wraps to the shape width (shape grows taller, width unchanged), an italic arrow label stays at the middle of the arrow, and a sticky note's auto-fit takes italic into account; a slanted last character is never clipped.\",\"source\":\"Accepted su","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T11:28:18.922Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"styles-and-history\",\"fact\":\"Paste styles, Ctrl+C then Ctrl+V, Ctrl+D, Alt+drag and library items carry a text's italic, and one italic toggle is undone with a single undo.\",\"source\":\"Accepted suggested answer 10 on issue 11404, 2026-10-13, approved by maxxx\",\"issue\":11404}","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T11:28:20.215Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"files-and-export\",\"fact\":\"Italic survives a page reload, a saved .excalidraw file, PNG and SVG export, copy as PNG/SVG and live collaboration; an older Excalidraw version opens a file with italic text without error and shows it upright.\",\"source\":\"Accepted suggested answer 9 on issue 11404,","outcome":"ok"}
